THE UNIT ROWS THIS EARNS (for W1's own suite, not this lane's):
  · a peer's write at a cell outside the armed hint leaves `hintReasoning` non-null
  · a peer's write at `hint.cell` nulls it
  · a peer's write at a `becauseCells` member nulls it
  · a peer's write anywhere leaves `lastRefusal` untouched
  · a local `setCell` still nulls both (the incumbent behaviour, pinned)
